TP4 local CUDA-Graph stage budget, random routes, cold L2
Date: 2026-09-03
Protocol: one GPU; 50 samples per implementation and M; each graph replay is
preceded by a separate 256 MiB L2 clear excluded from timing.  External CUDA
event nodes bracket every stage inside one captured graph, avoiding eager host
launch gaps and the Nsight Systems control deadlock.  Medians below are us.
CustomAllReduceV2 is deliberately excluded; this is a local compute diagnosis,
not the end-to-end headline benchmark.

