Custom/Humming total ratios for M8..M128:
0.9770 / 0.9537 / 0.9291 / 0.9215 / 0.9315.

Custom W13/W2 sums versus all other custom stages (us):
M8    core 80.512, other 25.728
M16   core 127.728, other 26.864
M32   core 197.216, other 27.280
M64   core 275.600, other 29.200
M128  core 333.696, other 32.288

To reach 0.8x the corresponding Humming local total, custom must fall by
19.251 / 24.915 / 31.190 / 40.198 / 51.654 us, or
18.12% / 16.12% / 13.89% / 13.19% / 14.11% of its present total.
At M32/M64/M128, even deleting every non-GEMM stage leaves the current GEMM
sum 3.91/11.00/19.37 us above the 20%-faster target.  Therefore a valid 20%
result necessarily requires additional W13/W2 core improvement.
